<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92830" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥύπος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], ὁ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dirt, filth</i>, used by <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> once in heterocl.pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάθηράν τε ῥύπα πάντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					6.93
				</span></i>
			: later in sg., <i><span class="en">
				Semon.
				7.63
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				82
			</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				892
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prm.</u>
				130c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				252
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				197
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἐν τοῖς ὠσὶ
			ῥ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				960b18
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				1.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Osl.</u>
				1.332
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. ὁ ἀπὸ τῶν ἐν τοῖς γυμνασίοις
					ἀνδριάντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					12.116
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἀπὸ τῶν ὀνύχων ῥύπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γρύ; ἅπαν ῥύπον</span>
			 all of it <i>filth</i> (acc.), <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				15.20
			</span></i>; of a person, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὸ μὴ λοῦσθαι ῥύπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristopho
					10.4
				</span></i>
			:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥύπος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, of cheese-<i>parings</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.64
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>sordidness, meanness</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ῥ. τοῦ χαμαὶ βίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					M.Ant.
					7.47
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sealing-wax</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ῥ. ἀνασπάσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					1198
				</span></i>
			.</div>
